{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/extras/772dacec7f72acff5e947d8c41ec350e.poster.avif?t=1769707723\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/extras/772dacec7f72acff5e947d8c41ec350e.webm?t=1769707723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/extras/772dacec7f72acff5e947d8c41ec350e.mp4?t=1769707723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2010, Harper Jones goes missing. After locally organised community efforts fail to track him down, Sheriff Oaklyn takes matters into her own hands. However, when she comes across an abandoned camera, her own search for the missing 17-year-old takes on a whole different tone than anticipated, revealing to her the unsettling nature of the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/extras/8a4421fe825de96cc297c47aabb4b1ca.poster.avif?t=1769707723\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/extras/8a4421fe825de96cc297c47aabb4b1ca.webm?t=1769707723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/extras/8a4421fe825de96cc297c47aabb4b1ca.mp4?t=1769707723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the areas surrounding the infamous lookout tower, Watcher\u2019s Point, in this short, narrative-driven experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric first-person exploration through a linear environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative progression through environmental photography, with occasional jump scares and complementary collectable notes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct photo categories for optional and required shots - snap a few unique shots of your own, if you so wish!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced dialogue and protagonist commentary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS2-style visuals inspired by classic, early 2000s horror games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15-30 minutes of playtime.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/extras/98f47b6f1d77664017d8efae26c6058f.poster.avif?t=1769707723\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/extras/98f47b6f1d77664017d8efae26c6058f.webm?t=1769707723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/extras/98f47b6f1d77664017d8efae26c6058f.mp4?t=1769707723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of short horror game experiences, of which Watcher\u2019s Point is the first instalment. We have creatively experimented with this one and hope to do so for future instalments, so we\u2019re interested to see where this will take us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/extras/ac97fa7ea743d241536fbe823406d30a.poster.avif?t=1769707723\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/extras/ac97fa7ea743d241536fbe823406d30a.webm?t=1769707723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/extras/ac97fa7ea743d241536fbe823406d30a.mp4?t=1769707723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Burning Cinder Games is a UK-based, remote indie game studio, whose work is championed by a passionate, tight-knit team that values collaboration, quality and creative experimentation.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826830?t=1769707723","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/8dd27d67666a7673ee3ff733e407c350ecccc587/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769707723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/7b3ba69e8f836846addcda6f80ff481376829c22/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769707723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/7b3ba69e8f836846addcda6f80ff481376829c22/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769707723","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/extras/772dacec7f72acff5e947d8c41ec350e.poster.avif?t=1769707723\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/extras/772dacec7f72acff5e947d8c41ec350e.webm?t=1769707723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared