830/298fe08de9a62c558b41386529992afef5fa6dfc/ss_298fe08de9a62c558b41386529992afef5fa6dfc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769707723","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826830/298fe08de9a62c558b41386529992afef5fa6dfc/ss_298fe08de9a62c558b41386529992afef5fa6dfc.600x338.jpg?t=1769707723"}],"short_description":"Harper Jones is missing. In a last-ditch attempt to find him, Sheriff Oaklyn heads out to the forest surrounding the infamous Watcher\u2019s Point to investigate. But she soon finds herself experiencing the unsettling nature of the forest, one snapshot at a time, when she discovers an abandoned camera.","steam_appid":3826830,"support_info":{"email":"burningcindergames@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}